    "ai_ingredient_spotlight": {
      "type": "ai-ingredient-spotlight",
      "blocks": {
        "ingredient_1": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Bakuchiol",
            "eyebrow": "The plant-based retinol alternative",
            "heading": "Bakuchiol (1%)",
            "source": "Source: babchi seeds",
            "body": "<p>Drawn from the seeds of the babchi plant (Psoralea corylifolia), bakuchiol is the botanical alternative to retinol. In our Night Serum it rests in organic rosehip and evening primrose oils, so skin looks smoother and more even by morning.</p>",
            "point_1": "Visibly softens the look of fine lines",
            "point_2": "Gentle enough for every night",
            "point_3": "100% plant-derived, never synthetic retinoids",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient_2": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Vegan peptides",
            "eyebrow": "For a firmer, bouncier look",
            "heading": "Vegan peptide complex",
            "source": "Never animal-derived",
            "body": "<p>Hexapeptide-11 and dipalmitoyl hydroxyproline are lab-crafted, vegan peptides. Paired with hyaluronic acid in our Contour Cream and Eye Cream, they leave skin looking firmer and feeling more supple.</p>",
            "point_1": "Skin looks firmer and more supple",
            "point_2": "Visibly smooths the look of crow's feet",
            "point_3": "Made without animal collagen",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient_3": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Hyaluronic acid",
            "eyebrow": "Hydration you can see",
            "heading": "Two weights of vegan hyaluronic acid",
            "source": "Vegan",
            "body": "<p>Sodium hyaluronate and hydrolyzed hyaluronic acid draw water into the skin's surface, hydrating for a plumper, smoother look that lasts all day.</p>",
            "point_1": "Hydrates for a plumper look",
            "point_2": "Two molecular weights, one cushiony cream",
            "point_3": "Never animal-derived",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient_4": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Sea-buckthorn",
            "eyebrow": "The golden oil",
            "heading": "Sea-buckthorn",
            "source": "In a COSMOS Organic formula",
            "body": "<p>The source of our Face Oil's sunset-gold color, sea-buckthorn is rich in omega fatty acids and carotenoids. With rosehip and jojoba, it seals in moisture for skin that looks luminous and supple.</p>",
            "point_1": "A lit-from-within look",
            "point_2": "Seals in moisture without heaviness",
            "point_3": "Blends into foundation for a glow",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ingredient_1",
        "ingredient_2",
        "ingredient_3",
        "ingredient_4"
