          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I've been vegan for years, and I kept hitting the same wall: the skincare that actually showed results leaned on animal-derived ingredients or harsh synthetics, and the vegan options looked like they belonged in a health-food aisle. So I built the line I wanted: plant actives, honest claims, and a shelf presence worth gifting. Every formula is 100% vegan and COSMOS certified.</p><p>— Angela, Founder</p>",
